  "detail_text": "SOURCES SOUGHT DLA Weapons Support (Columbus) is preparing to solicit a long-term contract for the NSN 1005-007070725. This announcement is considered market research in accordance with FAR Part 10. The solicitation will be synopsized separately later. The purpose of this notice is to identify qualified business concerns interested in submitting a proposal on the below listed NSN. Item details are as follows: NSN 1005-007070725 COVER,GUN MOUNT Estimated Annual Demand Quantity (ADQ) – 367 Unit of Issue – Each North American Industry Classification System Codes (NAICS) – 332994 NAICS Business Size – 1,000 The associated drawing number is listed below: IAW REFERENCE DRAWING NR (19207) 7070795 Sources interested in submitting a proposal on this forthcoming solicitation should complete the attached market research questionnaire and spreadsheet and return the completed copies to Samantha Simms at samantha.simms@dla.mil by April 22nd, 2026. Notice Attachments Include: 1. Market Research Questionnaire 2. Market Research NSN Spreadsheet 3. Product Item Description (PID)",
